music BGM01.mp3
text The first Tuesday after the holidays.
text Tomoyo and I are in the counseling room.
sound 7WI.aac
text @[Teacher]
text ...I wonder whether most of the student body consists of people who only fill out joke ballots.
sound 7WJ.aac
text @[Teacher]
text That's what we are wondering.
text The teacher standing in front of us... is the head of all the third-year teachers.
sound 7WK.aac
text @[Teacher]
text We made sure to investigate the reports from your previous school.
sound 7WL.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Well, it was quite quaint.
text @[Tomoya]
text What does that have to do with anything...?
text I grumble to myself.
sound 7WM.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Naturally, that was just for reference.
sound 7WN.aac
text @[Teacher]
text However, Sakagami-kun. Even in your previous school, you have caused disturbances many times.
sound 7WO.aac
text @[Teacher]
text You can't deny that, right?
text @[Tomoyo]
text ...
sound 7WP.aac
text @[Teacher]
text And now you're associating yourself with this student called Okazaki, who doesn't even normally go to school.
sound 7WQ.aac
text @[Teacher]
text You can't deny that, right?
text @[Tomoyo]
text ...
sound 7WR.aac
text @[Teacher]
text And so now this is the second time we've had you come here.
sound 7WS.aac
text @[Teacher]
text You haven't forgotten already?
text @[Tomoyo]
text ...
sound 7WT.aac
text @[Teacher]
text And there are cases besides this.
sound 7WU.aac
text @[Teacher]
text I'll raise them now.
text @[Tomoyo]
text ...
sound 7WV.aac
text @[Teacher]
text On the day you assumed office as student council president, neither of you was present in your morning homeroom.
sound 7WW.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Immediately after assuming office, you used the PA system for a private message.
sound 7WX.aac
text @[Teacher]
text And that message was directed at this boy.
sound 7WY.aac
text @[Teacher]
text And then, on the very day that was supposed to be your first job, the Founder's Festival...
sound 7WZ.aac
text @[Teacher]
text You left your position and went to have a rendezvous together.
sound 7X0.aac
text @[Teacher]
text This is all that we have been able to find out about. However...
text @[Tomoyo]
text ...
sound 7X1.aac
text @[Teacher]
text The fact is, a student like this is our school's student council president.
sound 7X2.aac
text @[Teacher]
text It's more than enough evidence to arrive at the conclusion that you are not a suitable candidate.
sound 7X3.aac
text @[Teacher]
text In the first place, do you not understand that, as a representative of the students, you are supposed to be a role model for them?
text @[Tomoyo]
text ...
text The teacher's eyes fall on a nearby paper.
sound 7X4.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Yet, for all that...
sound 7X5.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Unlike this boy, you're a very good student.
sound 7X6.aac
text @[Teacher]
text In your spring Academic Aptitude Test, you were at the top of your class across all three topics. And... fourth in the school.
sound 7X7.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Achieving that position in THIS school, I am compelled to say you are a truly excellent student.
sound 7X8.aac
text @[Teacher]
text And when faced with the attitude you seem to emanate, my assessment becomes solid.
sound 7X9.aac
text @[Teacher]
text It's not just a matter of leadership potential. You have the full confidence of your teacher and your classmates.
text @[Tomoyo]
text ...
sound 7XA.aac
text @[Teacher]
text In other words, within your own class at least, you have been consistently exhibiting exemplary behavior.
sound 7XB.aac
text @[Teacher]
text So this means that your reputation has only been suffering when you are outside the classroom.
sound 7XC.aac
text @[Teacher]
text I wonder, why could that be...?
text @[Tomoyo]
text ...
sound 7XD.aac
text @[Teacher]
text Somewhere that isn't your own classroom...
sound 7XE.aac
text @[Teacher]
text I wonder whether it's to do with the presence of this young man.
sound 7XF.aac
text @[Teacher]
text That is my personal guess.
sound 7XG.aac
text @[Teacher]
text It's still nothing more than an observation...
sound 7XH.aac
text @[Teacher]
text But in situations where he ISN'T around...
sound 7XI.aac
text @[Teacher]
text You conduct yourself like an actual student council president: a good and proper person.
sound 7XJ.aac
text @[Teacher]
text In other words...
sound 7XK.aac
text @[Teacher]
text There may still be hope for your future from here on out.
sound 7XL.aac
text @[Teacher]
text I WANT to have those hopes for you.
text @[Tomoyo]
text ...
sound 7XM.aac
text @[Teacher]
text That will be all for today.
sound 7XN.aac
text @[Teacher]
text We will have another talk on another day.
setvar strS[1000] = "BG016Y"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
