music BGM18B.mp3
text I agreed with everything the Head of the third-year teachers said.
text That's right. If only I weren't here, she would have been a suitable candidate for student council president.
text Even I had noticed.
text But despite that...
text At that time, inside that empty classroom...
text Tomoyo and I had wished to be together.
text And so now we're here.
text However, right now the reality that a guy like me is just holding Tomoyo back is being thrown right in my face.
text I wonder if I can be with her despite that.
text I want to be with Tomoyo.
text I'm sure that Tomoyo also wants to be with me... I have faith in that.
text But... if that's causing people to lose faith in her, then what?
